[00:19.657]In times of turmoil,
{"在动荡的时代，"}
[00:23.393]in times like these.
{"在这样的时刻。"}
[00:27.389]Belief is contagious,
{"信念具有传染性，"}
[00:31.073]spreading disease.
{"传播着疾病。"}
[00:35.017]This wretched mischief is now
{"这卑鄙的恶作剧如今"}
[00:38.361]coursing through your souls.
{"正侵蚀你们的灵魂。"}
[00:42.462]Never to let go,
{"永不放手，"}
[00:46.380]never to let go.
{"永不放手。"}
[00:54.243]Rats!
{"鼠辈！"}
[01:02.158]Into your sanctum
{"你们让他们进入"}
[01:06.024]you let them in.
{"你们的圣所。"}
[01:09.943]Now all your loved ones and all your kin.
{"如今你们所有挚爱和所有亲人。"}
[01:17.910]Will suffer punishments beneath the wrath of God.
{"将在上帝的怒火下遭受惩罚。"}
[01:24.989]Never to forgive,
{"永不原谅，"}
[01:28.829]never to forget.
{"永不遗忘。"}
[01:36.692]Rats...
{"鼠辈……"}
[01:52.548]This devastation left your cities to be burnt.
{"这场浩劫让你们的城市化为灰烬。"}
[01:59.915]Never to return,
{"永不归来，"}
[02:03.833]never to return.
{"永不归来。"}
[02:05.949]
[02:13.081]solo
[02:54.328]And filthy rodents are still coming for your souls.
{"而肮脏的鼠辈仍在觊觎你们的灵魂。"}
[03:01.851]Never to let go,
{"永不放手，"}
[03:05.613]never to let go.
{"永不放手。"}
[03:17.420]Rats...
{"鼠辈……"}
[03:32.989]They're still coming after you,
{"它们仍在追捕你们，"}
[03:36.516]and there's nothing you can do.
{"而你却无能为力。"}
[03:40.304]They're still coming after you,
{"它们仍会追着你，"}
[03:44.144]and there's nothing you can do.
{"而你却无能为力。"}
[03:48.611]Rats...
